{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand Meat Walker is an<strong>\u00a0FPS</strong>\u00a0that seeks to combine <strong>fast</strong>, <strong>gory</strong> action with a pet-like <strong>companion</strong> and a\u00a0<strong>retro</strong> style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803760/extras/9e147875a32d31678bc22595abd023a4.avif?t=1774542966\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam through old-fashioned, chunky maps. Explore, solve puzzles and massacre foes alongside your ally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of odd and powerful weapons, each playing a crucial role in your battles against the unbelonging creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bash them with a giant sword for health!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explode them for ammo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>robot</strong> is eager to rush into combat, handling simple tactics on its own, but relies on your commands to be at the right place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It uses powerful abilities you unlock as you progress. You can throw fruit at the robot to reward and encourage the use of these, The fighting style of your companion evolves based on your choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your progress anytime with an old-school, manual save system.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803760?t=1774542966","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803760/a2fa50d2a1b9d8587d7bb5b4389da32e7b122c6f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774542966","capsule_image":"https://sha